14
00:00:47,950 --> 00:00:49,070
I have to go to work tomorrow

15
00:00:49,270 --> 00:00:52,190
Is it because he will die tonight if he goes there? Can he get it back?

16
00:00:52,190 --> 00:00:53,230
Veteran players of Lu Cun Yuan

17
00:00:53,310 --> 00:00:55,550
